        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, computer, laptop, videoconference, certified electricity mix
The data set represents the use of a laptop computer during a videoconference. An average electricity consumption of 30W is set (certified electricity mix). ;
UUID: 0d6f55ac-7560-3bc0-8f18-ad07ab5e9526
This data set includes the use of a laptop and the energy consumption for a videoconference. It further includes the laptop production and transport from plant to customer).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Laptop use in videoconferences, 100% video mode (30W)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0d6f55ac-7560-3bc0-8f18-ad07ab5e9526.xml</text>
